<title>GERMANY: German April wholesale sales rise real 6.6 pct.</title>
<headline>German April wholesale sales rise real 6.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	 April 97  Mar	    April 96</p>
<p> Mth-on-mth change (adj,pct)   +1.9     -0.3	     +1.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (unadj,pct)   +6.6     -2.7	     +6.3</p>
<p> Index (adj, base 1991)	 106.4     97.7	     99.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Month-on-month and index figures are seasonally and calendar adjusted. Year-on-year is unadjusted. All figures are real. The nominal year-on-year increase was 7.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
